# Buck & Beard Hunt Club - Rules and Regulations

## Table of Contents
1. Club Overview
2. Safety Requirements
3. Hunting Guidelines
4. Property Access Rules
5. Member Responsibilities

## 1. Club Overview
Buck & Beard Hunt Club is a premier hunting organization dedicated to providing exceptional hunting experiences while maintaining the highest standards of safety and sportsmanship.

## 2. Safety Requirements
- All members must possess valid hunter safety certification
- Firearms must be handled according to club safety protocols
- Tree stands must be properly secured and inspected
- First aid kits required on all hunting trips

## 3. Hunting Guidelines
- Respect bag limits and hunting seasons
- Practice ethical hunting methods
- Report all harvested game to club management
- Follow fair chase principles

## 4. Property Access Rules
- Check-in required at club office
- Designated parking areas only
- Respect property boundaries
- Leave no trace policies apply

## 5. Member Responsibilities
- Annual dues must be current
- Participate in work days and maintenance
- Follow all club rules and regulations
- Treat all members and guests with respect

---
For questions about these rules, contact club management at buckandbeard@gmail.com